---

  <section class="faq-section" id="faq">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">COMMON QUESTIONS</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked&nbsp;Questions</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-container">
        <div class="faq-item active">
          <button class="faq-question" type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="faq-home-answer-0">
            <span>Which grades can begin training?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-home-answer-0">
            Kids in pre-K through 5th grade can begin training in our kids wrestling program. Practices focus on agility, tumbling, balance, basic stances, and listening in a supportive environment.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-home-answer-1">
            <span>What gear does my child need for their 3-day trial?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-home-answer-1">
            For the 3-day trial pass, your child just needs comfortable athletic shorts (without zippers or pockets) and a t-shirt. Wrestling shoes are recommended but socks are acceptable for their first trial days. We provide loaner headgear if needed. Arrive 15 minutes early for check-in and gear fitting, and call (510) 303-4869 to confirm your first session.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-home-answer-2">
            <span>Are there contracts or cancellation fees?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-home-answer-2">
            No. Memberships are month to month, with no contract and no cancellation fee. Monthly plans range from $89.99 to $150.00, depending on the program. See the pricing page for each plan.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-home-answer-3">
            <span>Where is the gym located and which cities do you serve?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-home-answer-3">
            United Wrestling Club is located at 30139 Industrial Pkwy SW Ste C, Hayward, CA 94544, easily accessible via I-880 and Highway 92. We serve families and competitors from Hayward, Union City, Fremont, Newark, Castro Valley, and San Leandro.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
